[*] --> Upload_Initiated_2f3d32
Upload_Initiated_2f3d32 --> File_Size_Check_fc1d4a : User initiates file upload
File_Size_Check_fc1d4a --> File_Upload_in_Progress_063524 : File size <= 5MB
File_Upload_in_Progress_063524 --> File_Uploaded_54da68 : Upload completes successfully
File_Uploaded_54da68 --> [*] : User views details and downloads file
File_Size_Check_fc1d4a --> Prompt_for_Smaller_File_a75ee3 : File size > 5MB
Prompt_for_Smaller_File_a75ee3 --> Upload_Initiated_2f3d32 : User chooses to upload smaller file
Prompt_for_Smaller_File_a75ee3 --> [*] : User cancels upload
@enduml
